* text=auto eol=lf

# All assets are stored in plain git, not Git LFS: cloud lanes cannot upload
# to the LFS endpoint (lfs.github.com returns 403). Keep every file under
# 50 MB (GitHub rejects files over 100 MB); large reproducible outputs stay
# out of git and are rebuilt by generators (engineering rule R15).
# Append-only logs: two lanes adding to the end of one conflict every time, and
# keeping both sides is right. `union` is built into git (no config), and the
# build lane's merge and cherry-pick both honour it. Only used where git would
# otherwise conflict; two edits to the same existing line keep both versions.
docs/program.md merge=union
docs/tuning.md merge=union

